&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-650131-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. Universal Antidote and Detoxification. UAD kits have proven to be 48% effective at removing symptoms of SCP-5266 if administered within 6 minutes of the event&#039;s onset.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-650131-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. Ex. &amp;quot;IDIOT SUCCUMBS TO NEUROTOXIN WHILE LISTENING TO MACHO MAN CLICK NOW TO SEE&amp;quot; in case 5266-51 or &amp;quot;DISCO GONE WRONG?!?!! OFFICE WORKER GETS POISONED&amp;quot; in case 5266-07&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-650131-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. Foundation cryptography teams have been assigned to decoding the signals, with success pending.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-650131-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. Substance may change depending on current target and their level of resistance, as indicated by the events of 08/11/2016.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-650131-5&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;5&lt;/a&gt;. Separate incident log is restricted to Level 3 personnel or higher.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-650131-6&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;6&lt;/a&gt;. Referred to as Entity M-A6 for the remainder of this documentation.&lt;/div&gt;
