han 95% human, please contact Administrator Wexley.&quot;);</li> <li>}</li> <li><span style="font-size:0%;">__</span></li> <li>// I know who's been editing the holy word.</li> <li><span style="font-size:0%;">__</span></li> <li>// I also know that they haven't been acting alone.</li> <li><span style="font-size:0%;">__</span></li> <li>// The other Admins and I have discussed it and have come to the only logical conclusion there is.</li> <li><span style="font-size:0%;">__</span></li> <li>// There are heretics among us.</li> </ol> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/marcelles-raynes" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5722579&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609127247" alt="Marcelles_Raynes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5722579)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/marcelles-raynes" >Marcelles_Raynes</a></span></p> 
